synonym: "failure to form egg cylinders" EXACT []
is_a: MP:0003085 ! abnormal egg cylinder morphology

[Term]
id: MP:0001695
name: abnormal gastrulation
def: "any anomaly in the development and invagination of the embryonic germ layers" [ISBN:0-683-40008-8]
comment: in the mouse, gastrulation initiates at E6.5, as cells of the primitive ectoderm (epiblast) delaminate at the posterior side of the embryo and ingress through the primitive streak in an epithelial-to-mesenchymal transition
