[Term]
id: MP:0001696
name: failure to gastrulate
def: "inability to differentiate and invaginate the primary germ layers" [https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3691-0324, ISBN:0-683-40008-8]
xref: GO:0007669
is_a: MP:0001695 ! abnormal gastrulation

[Term]
