def: "reduced motility of the cochlear OHCs in response to electrical stimulation" [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6490-7723]
synonym: "reduced cochlear outer hair cell electromotility" EXACT []
synonym: "reduced OHC electromotility" EXACT []
