[Term]
id: MP:0009849
name: increased vertical stereotypic behavior
def: "increase in the frequency of bursts of vertical crossings (greater than one per second) in a time period" [PMID:19720087]
is_a: MP:0001409 ! increased stereotypic behavior

[Term]
id: MP:0009850
