id: MP:0011756
name: abnormal kidney collecting duct beta-intercalated cell morphology
def: "any structural anomaly of the shorter, flatter cells found on the kidney collecting duct epithelium which secrete bicarbonate (via pendrin, a specialized apical Cl-/HCO3- exchanger) and reabsorb acid (via a basal H+-ATPase)" [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6490-7723]
synonym: "abnormal collecting duct beta-intercalated cells" EXACT []
