[Term]
id: MP:0011760
name: abnormal ureteric bud tip morphology
def: "any structural anomaly of the terminal ends of the ureteric tree; the ureteric tip cells are proliferating immature cells located at the branching points that induce the adjacent cap mesenchyme to undergo nephrogenesis" [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6490-7723]
