[Term]
id: MP:0012541
name: absent lamina terminalis
def: "absence of the anterior-most (rostral) portion of the wall of the neural tube, formed by closure of the anterior neuropore; agenesis of the lamina terminalis results in anencephaly" [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6490-7723]
