[Term]
id: MP:0013012
name: abnormal trunk neural crest cell migration
def: "any anomaly in the migratory path or behavior of the neural crest cells (NCCs) that arise from the trunk neural crest which lies between the vagal and sacral neural crest; there are two major pathways taken by the migrating trunk NCCs: (1) one group of cells fated to become melanocytes (the melanin-forming pigment cells) migrates dorsolaterally into the ectoderm towards the ventral midline and colonizes the skin and hair follicles; (2) a second group of cells migrates ventrolaterally through the anterior portion of each sclerotome; the cells that remain in the sclerotome form the dorsal root ganglia containing the sensory neurons, whereas those that continue more ventrally form the sympathetic ganglia, chromaffin cells of the adrenal medulla, Schwann (precursor) cells, and the nerve clusters surrounding the aorta" [http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK10065/, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6490-7723]
synonym: "abnormal body NCC migration" EXACT []
synonym: "abnormal body neural crest cell migration" EXACT []
synonym: "abnormal truncal NCC migration" EXACT []
synonym: "abnormal truncal neural crest cell migration" EXACT []
synonym: "abnormal trunk NCC migration" EXACT []
is_a: MP:0002950 ! abnormal neural crest cell migration
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3691-0324
created_by: csmith
creation_date: 2014-05-06T00:00:00Z

[Term]
id: MP:0013013
name: abnormal trunk neural crest cell morphology
def: "any structural anomaly of the neural crest cells (NCCs) that arise from the trunk neural crest (located between the vagal and sacral neural crest) and differentiate into a variety of cell types, including melanocytes, the neurons and glia of the dorsal root and sympathetic ganglia, Schwann (precursor) cells, chromaffin cells of the adrenal medulla, and the nerve clusters surrounding the aorta" [http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK10065/, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6490-7723]
synonym: "abnormal body NCC morphology" EXACT []
synonym: "abnormal body neural crest cell morphology" EXACT []
synonym: "abnormal truncal NCC morphology" EXACT []
synonym: "abnormal truncal neural crest cell morphology" EXACT []
synonym: "abnormal trunk NCC morphology" EXACT []
is_a: MP:0009845 ! abnormal neural crest cell morphology
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3691-0324
created_by: csmith
creation_date: 2014-05-06T00:00:00Z

