[Term]
id: MP:0013456
name: abnormal eccrine gland number
def: "aberration in the number of the coiled tubular glands normally situated on the digits and footpads of the paws of rodents, and both in the histologically thick skin of the palmar and plantar surfaces and in the thin skin that covers most of the rest of the body in humans; in mice these are the only sweat glands present" [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6490-7723]
is_a: MP:0000675 ! abnormal eccrine sweat gland morphology

[Term]
id: MP:0013457
name: increased eccrine gland number
