[Term]
id: MP:0013459
name: perioral dermatitis
def: "an inflammatory skin condition characterized by multiple small papules, pustules and vesicles localized to the perioral skin (around the mouth), perinasal or nasolabial folds (around the nostrils), or periocular area (around the eyes)" [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Perioral_dermatitis]
synonym: "periorifical dermatitis" EXACT []
