[Term]
id: MP:0013572
name: abnormal parathyroid gland chief cell morphology
def: "any structural anomaly of an epithelial cell that are collectively arranged in wide, irregular interconnecting columns in the parathyroid gland, that is responsible for the synthesis and secretion of parathyroid hormone (PTH)" [CL:0000446, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6490-7723]
synonym: "abnormal chief cell morphology" BROAD []
