[Term]
id: MP:0013718
name: galactostasis
def: "abnormal accumulation of milk within the mammary gland alveoli and ducts due to failure of ejection (letdown) from the gland; may be associated with nipple anatomic abnormalities" [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6490-7723]
