[Term]
id: MP:0030301
name: abnormal maxillary frontal process morphology
def: "any structural anomaly of the upward extension from the body of the maxilla which articulates with the frontal bone; the frontal process has a vertical ridge which constitutes the medial border of the orbit (anterior lacrimal crest); posteriorly it forms the lacrimal groove together with the lacrimal bone; superomedially it is in close contact with the anterior ethmoidal sinuses" [http://www.medilexicon.com/dictionary/72273, https://www.kenhub.com/en/library/anatomy/the-maxilla]
synonym: "abnormal frontal process of the maxilla morphology" EXACT []
synonym: "abnormal maxilla frontal process morphology" EXACT []
synonym: "abnormal nasal process of the maxilla morphology" RELATED []
synonym: "abnormal processus frontalis maxillae moprhology" EXACT []
is_a: MP:0000455 ! abnormal maxilla morphology
property_value: dc:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6490-7723
property_value: dc:date "2017-10-18T10:34:30Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: MP:0030302
name: abnormal maxillary zygomatic process morphology
def: "any structural anomaly of the rough triangular eminence situated at the angle of separation of the anterior, zygomatic, and orbital surfaces; in front, it forms part of the anterior surface; behind, it is concave, and forms part of the infratemporal fossa; above, it is rough and serrated for articulation with the zygomatic bone; below, it presents the prominent arched border which marks the division between the anterior and infratemporal surfaces" [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zygomatic_process_of_maxilla]
synonym: "abnormal malar process morphology" BROAD []
synonym: "abnormal malar process of the maxilla morphology" EXACT []
synonym: "abnormal maxilla zygomatic process morphology" EXACT []
synonym: "abnormal zygomatic process of the maxilla morphology" EXACT []
is_a: MP:0000455 ! abnormal maxilla morphology
property_value: dc:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6490-7723
property_value: dc:date "2017-10-18T11:03:20Z" xsd:dateTime

