[Term]
id: MP:0030495
name: absent tooth root
def: "absence of or failure to develop the part of a tooth that is implanted in the gum; normally, the root is located below the neck of the tooth, covered by cementum rather than enamel, and attached by the periodontal ligament to the alveolar bone" [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6490-7723]
synonym: "absence of tooth root" EXACT []
synonym: "absent dental root" EXACT []
