[Term]
id: MP:0030509
name: increased number of epithelial cell rests of Malassez
def: "increased number of epithelial cell remnants derived from the fragmentation of Hertwig's epithelial root sheath during root development that persist in the periodontal ligament close to the cementum surface" [CL:0002166, http://dental.pitt.edu/periohistology-glossary#cellrestsofmalassez]
synonym: "increased number of epithelial cells of Malassez" EXACT []
synonym: "increased number of epithelial rests of Malassez" EXACT []
