property_value: dc:date "2018-09-24T09:49:51Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: MP:0030800
name: abnormal patellar ligament morphology
def: "any structural anomaly of the central portion of the common tendon of the quadriceps femoris; it is attached to the apex of the patella and to the lower part of the tubercle of the tibia; it is sometimes called the patellar tendon as it is a continuation of the quadriceps tendon" [EMAPA:18509, https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Patellar_ligament, UBERON:0003676]
