def: "missing the irregular depression normally found on the posterior inner surface of the petrous portion of the temporal bone just below its crest and above and lateral to the internal acoustic meatus" [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6490-7723, ISBN:0-683-40008-8]
synonym: "absent floccular fossa" EXACT []
