id: MP:0031095
name: pharyngitis
def: "local accumulation of fluid, plasma proteins and leukocytes in the pharynx, most often caused by viral or bacterial infections; less common causes include allergies, trauma, cancer, reflux, and certain toxins" [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6490-7723, https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK519550/]
