id: MP:0031101
name: nasal obstruction
def: "a blockage within the nasal cavity, resulting in insufficient airflow through the nose; causes of obstruction include swelling of the mucous membrane (nasal congestion), nasal polyps, nasopharyngeal carcinoma or foreign bodies" [https://medical-dictionary.thefreedictionary.com/nasal+obstruction, https://www.uptodate.com/contents/nasal-obstruction-diagnosis-and-management]
