[Term]
id: MP:0031102
name: rhinorrhea
def: "increased discharge of fluid (typically a watery mucus fluid) from the nose; a common symptom of allergies or certain viral infections" [https://www.lexico.com/definition/rhinorrhoea, https://www.mayoclinic.org/symptoms/runny-nose/basics/definition/sym-20050640]
