[Term]
id: MP:0031103
name: skin rash
def: "an eruption in the skin which affects its appearance and/or texture; a rash may be localized to one part of the body, or affect all the skin; rashes may cause the skin to change color, itch, become warm, bumpy, dry, cracked or blistered, swell and may be painful" [NCIT:C39594]
synonym: "cutaneous eruption" EXACT []
synonym: "skin eruption" EXACT []
