[Term]
id: MP:0031110
name: meningitis
def: "local accumulation of fluid, plasma proteins, and leukocytes in the protective membranes (meninges) covering the brain and spinal cord, commonly caused by a bacterial or viral infection" [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meningitis, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6490-7723]
synonym: "inflammation of the meninges" EXACT []
synonym: "meningeal inflammation" EXACT []
