[Term]
id: MP:0031111
name: meningoencephalitis
def: "local accumulation of fluid, plasma proteins, and leukocytes in the brain and its surrounding protective membranes (meninges)" [https://medical-dictionary.thefreedictionary.com/meningoencephalitis, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6490-7723]
synonym: "encephalomeningitis" EXACT []
is_a: MP:0006082 ! CNS inflammation
