[Term]
id: MP:0031174
name: decreased mammary duct terminal end bud number
def: "reduced number of unique club-shaped epithelial structures formed at the tip of the mammary duct at the onset of puberty (approximately 3 weeks of age in mouse) under the action of circulating hormones; normally, TEBs proliferate, ramify, and actively invade the fad pad to allow the formation of a complex branching structure; this process of branching morphogenesis concludes at about 10-12 weeks of age in mouse, when TEBs have traversed the length of the fat pad and a fully developed ductal tree has formed" [PMID:16280048, PMID:16916375, PMID:18296651]
synonym: "decreased mammary duct TEB number" EXACT []
synonym: "reduced mammary duct TEB number" EXACT []
synonym: "reduced mammary duct terminal end bud number" EXACT []
is_a: MP:0013782 ! abnormal mammary duct terminal end bud morphology
property_value: dc:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6490-7723
property_value: dc:date "2020-10-27T08:48:02Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: MP:0031175
name: increased mammary duct terminal end bud number
def: "greater number of unique club-shaped epithelial structures formed at the tip of the mammary duct at the onset of puberty (approximately 3 weeks of age in mouse) under the action of circulating hormones; normally, TEBs proliferate, ramify, and actively invade the fad pad to allow the formation of a complex branching structure; this process of branching morphogenesis concludes at about 10-12 weeks of age in mouse, when TEBs have traversed the length of the fat pad and a fully developed ductal tree has formed; increase in TEBs is often associated with increased ductal outgrowth and branching morphogenesis" [PMID:16280048, PMID:16916375, PMID:18296651]
synonym: "increased mammary duct TEB number" EXACT []
is_a: MP:0013782 ! abnormal mammary duct terminal end bud morphology
property_value: dc:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6490-7723
property_value: dc:date "2020-10-27T08:57:20Z" xsd:dateTime

