id: MP:0031715
name: supraventricular tachycardia
def: "rapid heart rhythm originating at or above the atrioventricular node" [https://www.mayoclinic.org/diseases-conditions/supraventricular-tachycardia/symptoms-causes/syc-20355243, PMID:26399662, PMID:28723001]
comment: Supraventricular tachycardias are characterized by a narrow QRS complex and an elevated heart rate. They encompasses various atrial, junctional (ectopic), and atrioventricular tachycardias.
